OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1788285895
OL,3,CSir Kenny Dalglish and Karen Carney
OL,4,Chonoured with top PFA awards
OL,6,FSir Kenny Dalglish and Karen Carney
OL,7,Fhave received the Professional
OL,8,FFootballers' Association merit awards
OL,9,Ffor 2026 in recognition of their
OL,10,Fcontribution to football.
OL,12,FDalglish won six league titles and
OL,13,Fthree European Cups in a stellar
OL,14,Fplaying career with Liverpool, having
OL,15,Fjoined the Reds from Celtic in 1977
OL,16,Fwhere he had won four Scottish league
OL,17,Fcrowns.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
