PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1788285895
OL,3,CSir Kenny Dalglish and Karen Carney
OL,4,Chonoured with top PFA awards
OL,6,FHe went on to manage Liverpool,
OL,7,Fsecuring a league and FA Cup double as
OL,8,Fplayer-manager in 1986 before adding
OL,9,Ftwo more First Division titles in 1988
OL,10,Fand 1990 after retiring.
OL,12,FIn 1995 he led Blackburn to the
OL,13,FPremier League title, having helped
OL,14,Fthem to secure promotion to the top
OL,15,Fflight in 1992.
OL,17,FThe 75-year-old, who confirmed in June
OL,18,Fhe was undergoing treatment for
OL,19,Fcancer, is also Scotland's most capped
OL,20,Fplayer having represented his country
OL,21,Fon 102 occasions.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
