PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1788285895
OL,3,CSir Kenny Dalglish and Karen Carney
OL,4,Chonoured with top PFA awards
OL,6,FCarney played 144 times for England,
OL,7,Fincluding being part of the Lionesses
OL,8,Fsquad which finished third at the 2015
OL,9,FWorld Cup.
OL,11,FHaving come through the ranks at
OL,12,FBirmingham, Carney won the quadruple
OL,13,Fwith Arsenal in 2007 as well as a
OL,14,Fleague and FA Cup double with Chelsea
OL,15,Fin 2018.
OL,17,FCarney was appointed by the Government
OL,18,Fto undertake a review of the women's
OL,19,Fgame which was published in 2023, and
OL,20,Fwas awarded an OBE the following year
OL,21,Ffor services to football.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
