OL,3,CSir Kenny Dalglish and Karen Carney
OL,4,Chonoured with top PFA awards
OL,6,FShe has forged a successful career in
OL,7,Fthe media as a football pundit and
OL,8,Falso enjoyed success away from the
OL,9,Fsport as the winner of Strictly Come
OL,10,FDancing in 2025.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
